# Go stdlib CVEs in the esbuild binary bundled by @tanstack/react-start → vite.
# esbuild is a build tool CLI — it never handles HTTP requests or processes
# untrusted input in this context, so these net/http and crypto/tls CVEs
# are not exploitable. Base image updates (Dependabot) will keep esbuild
# up to date as newer versions ship with patched Go runtimes.
